Add visual feedback for toolbar button hover state.

Toolbar buttons currently show no hover indication. Add a subtle
highlight or color change on mouse hover.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] All toolbar buttons show hover highlight
- [ ] Hover color distinct from active/pressed state
- [ ] Hover feedback is subtle (not distracting)
- [ ] Works for all button types (toggle, momentary)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Hover over each toolbar button, verify visual change
- [ ] Verify hover clears when mouse leaves button area
- [ ] Verify active state still visually distinct from hover
